#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/6
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Hello,"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/16
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Okay. Here goes nothing..."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm scared."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "I'm scared."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/c-0/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "No need to fear. Hi. I'm just an anonymous hacker sending you a package."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/c-1/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Well, that’s not important. Think of me as a friendly yet anonymous hacker."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Any second now you will receive a delivery via drone to your front door. Tell absolutely no one it is in your possession."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I will return with further instructions when the time is right."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "When’s that?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool, sounds fun!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Boring."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "When's that?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/c-2/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Uh, well. Not now."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Cool, sounds fun!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/c-3/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Perhaps."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Boring."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_1/0/g-0/c-4/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I fear I may have made a mistake..."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/6
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Impressive news out of Valfest. Really too bad that particular partnership is about to hit a rough patch."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/11
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "But then David’s never been great at partnerships."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me neither."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Ok?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Me neither."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/c-1/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Yeah, fascinating, but we're not talking about you right now."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I see you’ve had the opportunity to test out the prototype."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, it's been going okay."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can see me?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Yeah, it's been going okay."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "You can see me?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I have remote access. Allows me to analyze the back-end system data."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/14
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "What’d you think, that I’d just hand over absolute control of a device this powerful?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/19/0/s/0 thiscord_phone/tfh_14/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa. Chill out."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/19/c-0/7 thiscord_phone/tfh_14/0/g-1/c-4/13
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/19/c-1/13
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Whoa. Chill out."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-0/c-3/19/c-1/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’m sorry; that was rash."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’m enormously grateful to you for concealing the prototype. And I’m sorry I dropped all this on you so unexpectedly."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I know protecting it is not a responsibility you asked for. Maybe not even a responsibility you want."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/10
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "But I had no other choice. Every other Valdivian employee’s allegiance was unknowable — except you."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can count on me!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "You can count on me!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I knew you were trustworthy."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-4/20
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Your private HR record said as much."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-5/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Because you’re paid the least out of everyone."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-5/14/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-5/14/c-0/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Wait seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-1/c-5/14/c-0/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I can’t get into that right now."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Anyway, it’s not safe to talk. I will return when the signal is secure."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/6
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Based on how plastered David was in his last MostMail, he must’ve finally discovered the prototype is missing..."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/11
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "He’ll sober up soon though, and when he does he’ll stop at nothing to ensure its retrieval."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/16
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "If he fails, he’ll be at the mercy of some very powerful people. He’ll never allow that."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How do you know all this?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you trust me to do this? I'm just an average nobody..."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "How do you know all this?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Do you trust me to do this? I'm just an average nobody..."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I guess it’s imperative that we trust each other. And I’ve been asking you to trust me, without being fully transparent. I know all this because..."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/10
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I created the dateviators."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Prove it."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah I basically guessed that."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "That's awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I'm glad you think so. We are obviously in alignment."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Prove it."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "There's no time for that."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Yeah I basically guessed that."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Hm. Sure. Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Anyway, I can’t talk now."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-1/5 thiscord_phone/tfh_15/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’m stealing coffeeshop wifi and the barista finally noticed I’m only ordering tap water."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_3/0/g-1/10
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Remember: under no circumstance allow David to know you possess the prototype!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/6
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Unfortunate about Sandy in Corporate Events Planning. She was responsible for all the best casual Friday themes."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/11
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Now that she’s gone, there’s finally nothing left of the 7 Pioneers."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "7 Pioneers?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This isn't going to be more lore is it?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "7 Pioneers?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "This isn't going to be more lore is it?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Lore? No, it's incredibly important and compelling background information that is <i>necessary</i> to understand the current situation."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "In the beginning there were seven of us. Working out of David’s dorm room. Stealing wifi from the neighbors and using cardboard boxes for chairs."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "We had no idea we were changing the world..."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/10
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "We just wanted to design a more efficient paperclip."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "But then the money started flowing and money always changes people."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/20
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Didn’t take long for the 7 Pioneers to be whittled down to one."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... David."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... you?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sneezy!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "... David."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-2/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "<i>Bingo.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "... you?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Not me."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/14
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "David. The CEO of Valdivian."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/19
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Seems like you're not paying attention but I suppose it can't be helped."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/24
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I am mysterious and only message you sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/0/s/0 thiscord_phone/tfh_7/0/g-2/c-5/14/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotcha."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm paying attention!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine, whatever."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/7 thiscord_phone/tfh_7/0/g-2/c-5/14/c-0/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Gotcha."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-0/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "I'm paying attention!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-1/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "So you say."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-3/29/c-2/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Fine, whatever."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Sneezy!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I <i>really</i> need you take this seriously."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "And all this? The wretched, soul-sucking, corporate monster that Valdivian became? The Pioneers never wanted that."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "One-by-one they left, but I stayed."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-1/10
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Deep down I really believed David — the old David — was still in there somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-1/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "But when he wanted to use the Dateviators for military applications, I knew more drastic action was necessary. Quickly."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you stole them?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "So you stole them?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’m sorry, but there’s no time."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-2/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’m using the display phone at a wireless store and they closed 30 minutes ago."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-2/10
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "The sales associate is giving me the stink eye."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_4/0/g-2/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’ll follow up when I can!"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/6
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’m sorry for the abrupt intrusion"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/11
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid ", but there’s an urgent topic I need to discuss with you immediately."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/16/b/1
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Assuming you're going to take my questions seriously. Your commitment to this mission so far has been... questionable."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/19
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Is everything alright with the dateviators? Are they operating efficiently?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think so. Why?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, they broke completely."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "I think so. Why?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "No, they broke completely."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/c-1/9
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Completely? I don't believe that's correct."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/c-1/14
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I'm not one to be trifled with."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Well as you know, I’m able to remotely monitor their functionality, and I’ve been noticing some deeply troubling readings coming from the Quantum Catalyst Activator."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope the Quantum Catacomb Active-wear is all good."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s that?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Nope the Quantum Catacomb Active-wear is all good."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "<i>Quantum Catalyst Activator.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-0/c-2/20
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "And I haven't even told you what it is yet."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "It’s very sci-fi, but essentially the Quantum Catalyst Activator is the internal hardware that allows you to directly acknowledge a thing’s existence. And recently it’s started to emit metacognition readings unlike any I’ve ever seen before."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’ll keep an eye on things over here, but please inform me if anything unusual happens."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/10
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Oh, and if they get too hot, throw them in the freezer immediately."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Your life depends on it."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait why?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I throw them in the fridge instead?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for letting me know."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Wait why?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Can I throw them in the fridge instead?"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Are you <i>insane?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Thanks for letting me know."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "Sorry it’s not safe to talk anymore."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-2/5
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "I’m in a really sketchy neighborhood and this phone is super, duper expensive."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_5/0/g-2/13
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "But I’ll keep analyzing the data."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: thiscord_phone/tfh_6/0/11
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid "are you there? Please answer! Hurry!"
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_6/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I'm here."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_6/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't work for you, dude."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_6/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "Yes, I'm here."
msgstr ""

#: thiscord_phone/tfh_6/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Player"
msgid "I don't work for you, dude."
