#: thiscord_phone/tfh_11/0/g-0/15
msgctxt "tinfoilhat"
msgid "What David and I had, and what I ultimately lost, shred my soul right down to the atoms. And I so <i>intensely</i> distrusted falling in love with another person again, that I went and invented goggles to flirt with inanimate objects instead."
